# Converted ONNX artifacts. A single tier is ~0.5 GB of graph + external
# weights, reproducible from <output.dir>/run/merged via `wasmtune convert`,
# and the demo serves the tuned tier from the Hub — so they are publish inputs,
# not repo content. Without this, `git add -A` after a convert stages gigabytes.
*.onnx
*.onnx_data
demo/public/models/*/onnx/

